1004	    /// `with_truth`/`with_spare`. Shares storage with `truth`/`with_truth`
1005	    /// — the last writer of either view wins, by construction, since it is
1006	    /// one 2-bit register read through two lenses. See
1007	    /// [`crate::layout::CausalTopology`] for the compatibility statement.
1008	    #[inline]
