22	/// For k=256: 256 × 256 × 2 bytes = 128 KB → fits L1 cache.
23	///
24	/// This IS the attention score matrix, precomputed for all possible
25	/// palette-index pairs. At inference time, looking up the attention
26	/// between query token i and key token j is:
27	///
28	/// ```text
